    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_val_i_d" kindref="compound">ValID</ref> - Represents a reference of a definition of some sort with no type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>There are several cases where we have to parse the value but where the type can depend on later context. This may either be a numeric reference or a symbolic (var) reference. This is just a discriminated union. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
